  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Roll out the pastry crust and place it in a tart pan.",
    "In a blender, combine the tamarind paste, coconut sugar, almond milk, energizing powder, and shredded coconut. Blend until smooth.",
    "Pour the filling into the pastry crust.",
    "Sprinkle the chopped fresh mint leaves on top of the filling.",
    "Bake the tart for 35-40 minutes, or until the crust is golden brown.",
    "Remove the tart from the oven and let it cool for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the tart warm, garnished with additional fresh mint leaves if desired."
